[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=WPS 最近文档复制
Name[en]=WPS Recent Documents Copy
GenericName=复制 WPS 文档到剪贴板
GenericName[en]=Copy WPS document to clipboard
Comment=选中 WPS 最近文档里的文件，直接放进剪贴板，可在桌面和微信里粘贴
Comment[en]=Pick a file from WPS recent documents and put it on the clipboard
Exec=wps-copy --gui
Icon=wps-file
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=true
StartupWMClass=wps-clip-bridge
Categories=Utility;
Keywords=wps;clipboard;copy;paste;复制;粘贴;剪贴板;
